[00:00.00]
[00:00.00]
[00:00.00]
[00:00.00]
[00:00.00]
[00:03.040]Don't get too close
{"别靠得太近"}
[00:05.600]That place is haunted
{"那地方闹鬼"}
[00:08.040]Fear not the ghosts
{"别怕那些幽灵"}
[00:10.580]Cause she sent them running
{"因她已将它们驱退"}
[00:15.920]She sleeps beneath the surface
{"她沉睡在深渊之下"}
[00:21.370]Consorting with the serpents
{"与毒蛇为伍密谋"}
[00:26.270]She strikes without a purpose
{"她无端发起攻击"}
[00:35.000]A dark face in a corridor
{"走廊里的阴暗面孔"}
[00:37.250]Deceptively beautiful
{"美丽却暗藏欺骗"}
[00:39.320]She's watching you
{"她正注视着你"}
[00:41.130]She's in everything you do
{"渗透你每个举动"}
[00:45.170]Her kiss it tastes so sweet
{"她的吻如此甘甜"}
[00:47.060]But left me with a lethargy
{"却让我陷入昏沉"}
[00:50.130]I couldn't shake
{"我无法摆脱"}
[00:51.590]I'd made a great mistake
{"犯下大错的我"}
[00:54.900]I gave her my heart
{"将真心献给她"}
[00:56.900]She didn't want it
{"她却并不想要"}
[00:57.960]Took it anyway and put a dark spell on it
{"强行夺走并施下黑暗诅咒"}
[01:00.659]Since then I haven't been the same
{"自那以后我判若两人"}
[01:05.980]Needed a victim and she got it
{"她需要祭品便得到我"}
[01:08.329]Took me in with her song
{"用歌声诱我入彀"}
[01:09.659]Powerless to stop it
{"无力抵抗这阴谋"}
[01:11.110]Some men don't dare to speak her name
{"有人不敢提她名讳"}
[01:26.590]She picked me up from my decline
{"她将颓废的我救起"}
[01:29.530]Healed my wounds with love and wine
{"用爱与美酒治愈伤痕"}
[01:32.150]Dosed me up and closed my eyes a taste of poison
{"灌下毒药闭上双眼　品尝这致命滋味"}
[01:37.019]She gave me all that I desired
{"她给予我渴望的一切"}
[01:40.110]Sung the songs of angel choirs
{"吟唱天使圣歌般甜美"}
[01:42.530]Preached the words of death and fire and left me burning
{"却宣扬死亡与烈焰　留我在火中焚毁"}
[01:47.200]I gave her my heart
{"我献出整颗真心"}
[01:48.569]She didn't want it
{"她根本不屑一顾"}
[01:49.819]Took it anyway and put a dark spell on it
{"强行夺走并施加黑暗诅咒"}
[01:52.690]Since then I haven't been the same
{"从此我判若两人"}
[01:57.819]Needed a victim and she got it
{"她需要祭品便轻易得手"}
[02:00.230]Took me in with her song
{"用歌声诱我入彀"}
[02:01.480]Powerless to stop it
{"无力挣脱这魔咒"}
[02:02.879]Some men don't dare to speak her name
{"有些男人不敢提她名讳"}
[02:11.110]She sleeps beneath the surface
{"她蛰伏在深渊之下"}
[02:16.740]Consorting with the serpents
{"与毒蛇共舞交加"}
[02:21.780]She strikes without a purpose
{"漫无目的突然猎杀"}
